# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# uv-managed lab/demo projects (labs/*/*/pyproject.toml) each get their own
# .venv/ and local data files — never committed, regenerated with `uv sync`.
.venv/
.env
*.duckdb


# OS
.DS_Store

# .vscode/ is intentionally NOT ignored — it's a shared, committed workspace
# (see .vscode/README.md), not personal editor state. If you keep local-only
# overrides, use .vscode/settings.local.json (not part of this repo's
# convention today, but the natural place if you ever need one) instead of
# re-adding a blanket ignore here.
